# Same reason, different directories: the baseline profile copies `.github/agents`
# and `.github/skills` in whole, so everything under them is upstream territory
# even where this repository keeps skills of its own. Two of the incoming files
# are not prettier-clean, and reformatting them here would be reverted by the
# next sync -- or worse, reported as a local modification and block it.
.github/agents/
.github/skills/

